Origin and modifications
------------------------
This work is a derivative of the Cindy open-source client:

  Upstream:  https://github.com/makecindy/cindy
  Baseline:  fdb0f8adb92aade1e141ca95d02b7d8b83600132  (2026-08-06)

  Upstream:  https://github.com/makecindy/cindy-protocol   (vendored at cindy-protocol/)
  Baseline:  90e6f3188022f4b13545c186ea11c2f1426c66f9

As required by Apache-2.0 section 4(b), the following files carry modifications
by Leo Yuan, beginning 2026-08-06:

  * packages/maker-shared/src/branding.ts
      Display brand name changed to LeoAgent.

  * packages/maker-shared/src/brandIdentity.ts
      Identifier-layer identity replaced (executable name, bundle id / AUMID,
      deep-link scheme, userData directory, CDN prefix, updater name, database
      file prefix). Upstream legacy-compatibility anchors were cleared: they
      exist to claim the upstream product's installed base, which this product
      neither has nor should adopt.

  * apps/desktop/src/main/clientEndpointsService.ts
      Packaged builds now read the endpoint manifest bundled inside the
      application instead of fetching it from a remote CDN at startup. The
      strict parse and validation semantics are unchanged; only the source of
      truth moved. This product is self-hosted and has no remote configuration
      service.

  * apps/desktop/forge.config.ts
      Product identity literals; the bundled endpoint manifest added to
      extraResource.

  * apps/desktop/package.json, apps/desktop/scripts/ci/lib.mjs,
    apps/desktop/scripts/smoke-packaged.mjs, scripts/restart-desktop-remote.mjs
      Packaged-artifact name mirrors kept in sync with the identity above.

  * apps/desktop/src/renderer/i18n/locales/{en,zh-CN,ja,ko}/common.json
      User-visible product name in message values. Message keys are unchanged.

  * apps/desktop/src/renderer/components/settings/AboutSection.tsx
      Upstream community links removed.

  * config/endpoint.json, config/endpoint.global.json,
    apps/desktop/resources/endpoints/endpoint.json
      Service endpoints no longer point at upstream-operated servers.

  * apps/desktop/resources/icon.icns, icon.png, icon-dock.png,
    icon-master-1024.png
      Application icon replaced.

